Template: strata/mirror-disks
Type: multiselect
Choices-C: ${DEVS}
Choices: ${CHOICES}
Description: The two system disks (mirror)
 StrataOS is installed on both disks at once (RAID 1): the NAS keeps
 starting and running when one of them fails.
 .
 Choose exactly two disks, ideally of the same size. Both are completely
 erased. Data disks are added later from the web interface: do not select
 them here.

Template: strata/mirror-wrong
Type: error
Description: Choose two disks
 The system mirror needs exactly two disks.
